            <p>We want to be completely transparent: the possibility of purchasing License Packages directly from the Company is a **one-time and time-limited opportunity** exclusively related to this development phase. After the official launch of the SFT21 platform, SFnet, and SFshop, the Company will permanently suspend the sale of License Packages, and the number of licenses granting the right to passive participation in bonuses will be final.</p>
